  "changes": [
    "Reduce frozen-map copying and per-message tuple/stringification overhead in sparse patch creation/application.",
    "Validate translation messages without allocating all entry tuples.",
    "Snapshot only mutable patch children; seal owned result containers and share recognized immutable baseline messages.",
    "Stop registry equivalence checks at the first changed message before allocating complete key lists.",
    "Restore runtime profiling for the current bounded base existence check."
  ],
